https://api.github.com/users/zakkak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakkak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakkak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakkak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakkak/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakkak/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakkak/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakkak/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakkak/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2025-06-02T07:02:25Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/2930098970","html_url":"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/48087#issuecomment-2930098970","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/48087","id":2930098970,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCFbutM6upcMa","user":{"login":"zakkak","id":1435395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzUzOTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1435395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakkak","html_url":"https://github.com/zakkak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakkak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakkak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakkak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakkak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakkak/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakkak/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakkak/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakkak/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakkak/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-02T11:13:37Z","updated_at":"2025-06-02T11:13:37Z","body":"@geoand I see `org.jboss.vfs.VirtualFileFilter` being reached through https://github.com/flyway/flyway/blame/main/flyway-core/src/main/java/org/flywaydb/core/internal/scanner/classpath/jboss/JBossVFSv3ClassPathLocationScanner.java which is being registered for reflection:\n\n```\n  {\n    \"allDeclaredClasses\": true,\n    \"allDeclaredConstructors\": true,\n    \"name\": \"org.flywaydb.core.internal.scanner.classpath.jboss.JBossVFSv3ClassPathLocationScanner\",\n    \"allDeclaredMethods\": true,\n    \"allDeclaredFields\": true\n  },\n```\n\nPassing `-Dquarkus.native.include-reasons-in-config-files` to the build I see that the \"reason\" it is being registered is:\n\n```\n      \"PicocliNativeImageProcessor > fr.mipih.dumpbo.SubCommand > org.flywaydb.core.Flyway > org.flywaydb.core.FlywayExecutor > org.flywaydb.core.internal.scanner.LocationScannerCache > java.util.Map > org.flywaydb.core.internal.scanner.classpath.ClassPathLocationScanner\"\n```\n\nSimilarly for `org.flywaydb.core.internal.resource.s3.AwsS3Resource` which leads to `software.amazon.awssdk.awscore.exception.AwsServiceException`:\n\n```\n      \"PicocliNativeImageProcessor > fr.mipih.dumpbo.SubCommand > org.flywaydb.core.Flyway > org.flywaydb.core.api.configuration.ClassicConfiguration > org.flywaydb.core.api.ResourceProvider > java.util.HashMap > org.flywaydb.core.api.resource.LoadableResource\"\n```\n\nWhich indicates that the class is being registered for reflection [by the picocli extension](https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/blob/88579588d23e8da65f39f5197a0020e9515c4f35/extensions/picocli/deployment/src/main/java/io/quarkus/picocli/deployment/PicocliNativeImageProcessor.java#L106-L109) through the class hierarchy of `fr.mipih.dumpbo.SubCommand`. And more specifically by registering `org.flywaydb.core.internal.scanner.classpath.ClassPathLocationScanner` implementers in https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/blob/5cd8a5e741fd56d0d8dae52a8a519a443a25d883/core/deployment/src/main/java/io/quarkus/deployment/steps/ReflectiveHierarchyStep.java#L162-L168\n\nIt looks like this could be fixed by:\n1. augmenting https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/blob/71538fbca674a6ccbdf5eab57576a9ab946dd975/core/deployment/src/main/java/io/quarkus/deployment/builditem/nativeimage/ReflectiveHierarchyBuildItem.java#L360 but I can't tell if that's the right thing to do.\n2. Removing `JBossVFSv3ClassPathLocationScanner` (and `AwsS3Resource`?) from the classpath when not needed. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/2930098970/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"zakkak","id":1435395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzUzOTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1435395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakkak","html_url":"https://github.com/zakkak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakkak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakkak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakkak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakkak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakkak/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakkak/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakkak/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakkak/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakkak/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":17930721309,"node_id":"MEE_lADOCFbutM64aqSzzwAAAAQswRgd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/events/17930721309","actor":{"login":"geoand","id":4374975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNzQ5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercon